# OTA update channel for /usr/sbin/pgenerator-update.
#
# The first non-comment line is the GitHub repository (owner/repo) whose
# Releases are checked for OTA tarballs. This is the single place to change
# the default update source of a build.
#
# Precedence (first valid value wins): env GITHUB_REPO, then
# update_repo=owner/repo in /etc/PGenerator/PGenerator.conf, then this file,
# then BigShoots/PGenerator-Plus. Values that are not a plain owner/repo are
# ignored.
